### Weakness 4: Limited ablation studies on key algorithmic components

While the paper includes one ablation study (Section 6.4) comparing the preference learning objective versus exploration strategy, it lacks systematic ablations on other important design choices such as: the decay schedule for λ₁ and λ₂ (mentioned in line 331 but relegated to Appendix E.6), the choice of reference policy beyond the random initialization experiment (Appendix G.8), and the sensitivity to the quality of the initial proxy reward function.

