## Weaknesses

### 1. Limited Real-World Experimental Validation

The paper relies primarily on one real-world dataset (Norman gene expression data) and validates results using a prior knowledge database (Enrichr). This raises concerns about broader applicability.

**Quote from relevant review (Nx4PMtJ1ER, Human Reviewer 3):**
