### **6. Ablation studies relegated to appendix without sufficient detail in main text**

The paper mentions ablation studies (Section 4.1) but provides minimal detail in the main text, making it difficult to understand which components are critical.

**Retrieved review quote (SELFIES-TED - uPj9oBH80V, Reviewer 4):**
